==Battleground==
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*8 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 3~4 seconds<sup>90f~120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[One Horn]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Even though this stage can be considered easier than [[First Round (Easy)]], very early-game players may struggle if they built their lineup for [[First Round (Easy)]]. The One Horns are the main threat of this battle, as there are '''9''' of them that spawn gradually over time, with Mooth spawning as the backline after about 3 seconds. Take out Mooth as early as possible with units like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] before the first One Horn gets in front of Mooth, as then it will become much more difficult to defeat the Mooth. Thankfully, you have a lot of room to work with, so this should not be that difficult to pull off. When you defeat Mooth, just chip down the One Horns. If they are pushing too much, use [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|crowd-controllers]] such as [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Pirate Cat]] or [[Bean Cats (Special Cat)|Bean Cats]].

